# The circle tour: one full CCW circle of radius ~250 mm, driven as an arc
# twist (v = omega * r). Gated behind the square's closure by the runner.
# 150 mm/s at 0.6 rad/s -> r = 250 mm; a full turn is 2*pi rad = 360 deg.

MARK circle
TWIST vx=150 omega=34.4 angle=360 timeout=30
STOP dwell=0.5

CAMFIX x=0 y=0 radius=100
